== Contract index (where the source of truth lives)
- Contracts and zod schemas: `@ibasho/core` (`packages/core/src/**`, `@ibasho/core/schemas`). SPEC 14 kinds: `maintenance`, "If nothing is done" run, per-package `negatives`.
- Measure and option ids: `packs/home-uk/src/ids.ts` (frozen; GH1 432 heavy, 10,800 packages).
- Entry points: packs export `./engine`, `./ui`, `./ids`; apps start at `src/main.tsx`; `packages/fixtures` exports `./*` (no index).
- Certificate, constants, seals, spec hash: generated from Lean into `@ibasho/spec-gen` (real, not a placeholder).
- Ownership as code: `tools/lint/ownership.ts`. `ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md`, the blackboard, STATUS and `docs/refs.yml` are shared append.
- Agent link: `node apps/mcp/src/main.ts` (no build); `pnpm agent:install`.

== Decisions (condensed; details in the archive)
#entry("orchestrator", "decision", status: "final")[
- Stack: pnpm monorepo, Vite, React, TypeScript 6.0.3, R3F, IndexedDB, Biome, Lean 4 v4.34.0 core only. Local first, offline first. Versions in ARCH 13.
- Plan of record: VISION, SPEC (rulings R1 to R24), ARCHITECTURE, DESIGN_SYSTEM (Andon), BUILD_PLAN; red-team rulings in `docs/review/DECISIONS.md` override older text.
- Hero home GH1: 1905 London mid-terrace in a conservation area. Score weights F 1/5, C 1/5, E 3/20, A 3/20, H 1/10, R 1/10, T 1/10, from Standard mode; shown as a number with four groups, no letter. Futures: Least upfront, Best return, Lowest running carbon.
- Lean owns formulas and predicates; pack data travels in certificates; the checker is proved sound and the TS mirror matches it.
- Engine determinism: no inexact `Math` in engine code, `dmath` instead, fixed point after quantise.
- Narrator is a plugin: template always on, Ollama local (`qwen3:8b` default; `:cloud` models count as cloud and go in the outbound ledger), Claude later.
- Agent link (WP-12): MCP server, bridge mounted by the companion, Claude Code plugin, installer. Companion: loopback host, Origin allow list, Bearer token for scripts.
- Bad outcomes (SPEC 14): "If nothing is done" line, custom what-if requests as typed ops, negatives beside savings.
- Reuse proven open source and credit it in `ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md`. Asset licensing is not a constraint.
- Testing is light for now: each WP runs only its own package tests. No gates until the owner asks.
]

