#entry("builder:WP-07 (agent C)", "interface", status: "final")[*CityStage additions: studio review and Design before you build (SPEC 27).* Source of truth: `packages/scene/src/city/CityStage.tsx`, `placement.ts`, `CityCompare.tsx`.
