r copy as sentences), m8, m13 (time strip only in Look). QA round 1 folded: places in the search index, `replacedIds`, `ECSBC.EPI-RATIO`, new money and comfort settings in the ledger, block hits focus by box, place hits. *Left:* B-m9 unmount warning, B-m10 search grouping cap, B-m11 home card menu, B-m12 font preload, compare difference drawing (needs C). *Tests (each once, capped, one worker):* web 4 files 23 passed, ui 10 files 89 passed, editor 5 passed; typecheck and Biome clean on owned paths.]
